//
// Baseline habitats follow the Generation III Pokedex habitat taxonomy
// (cave, forest, grassland, mountain, rough terrain, sea, urban, waters-edge).
// The canonical "rare" bucket is intentionally resolved into physical habitats
// so rare/legendary species participate in the same equal-probability rules as
// every other eligible species.
//
